note The read-only half of the CLI: the commands that answer questions about the source rather than the map. files, symbols, show and grep all walk the in-memory index directly, and every one of them prints one item per line in a file:line shape so the output can be pasted back into another command or parsed like grep output. These four are what the agent falls back to when no path covers the code it needs.

